{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone\u2019s favorite dinosaur with a gentle heart in the Jurassic Era, \u201cDino.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, indiscriminate slaughter by brutal dinosaurs has begun in a peaceful forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDino\u201d sees his lovely girlfriend, \u201cMeeshell\u201d and his friends trying to escape, and decides to fight for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curls up himself, transforms into a ball with hyper strong power, and attack the enemy dinosaurs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDino\u201d is taking a step into his epic adventure to bring peace back to the sky, sea and earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stages are inspired by the Earth 200 million years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This hierarchal action pinball game that you will explore on land, sea and sky, and attack the enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Natural disaster and sudden weather change will bring you more excitement. Volcanic explosions, tectonic movements, seas filled by lava, sand storms and more\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful visual arts and impressive sounds and music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gallery: view images from the original game\u2019s illustrations, posters, box design, etc. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jukebox: listen to any of the game music tracks any time you want. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewind/Turbo function: repeat something until you achieve perfection, or speed things up </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheats function: activate cheats that will make your mission a lot easier (infinite lives, invulnerability, etc.) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save state function: save wherever you want to in the game, and restart from that exact point </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screen filters: select from several filters to modify how the game looks (retro-style monitor, black-and-white, etc.) </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is re-release of \u201cDino Land\u201d which the first launched in 1990s for home consoles.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"CAVE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393950/9f2d06a560c358d1955e4708b505be24cad379f2.jpg"},{"name":"OCEAN","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393950/1ec0c61bc353bbfe16d1a59b0f229fe4418ed9e7.jpg"},{"name":"SKY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393950/63946d91b6b9358473510139e2a48673a199694f.jpg"},{"name":"NEON","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393950/0ff45b467496e12081c4aaa31b7b1570673b800e.jpg"},{"name":"Multi Dino","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393950/839add79b5943994fcb97f793b3ed38a25e3949a.jpg"},{"name":"100K","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393950/bedfbd772e42ecf646c1b9a88f470241ec060c4d.jpg"},{"name":"250K","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393950/2dd41e8607551c50ce11b9d718fddb55d7db37c6.jpg"},{"name":"500K","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393950/10646a3bc643868145a6d6cab430b5d989598ee6.jpg"},{"name":"1M","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393950/1a0e85badbdc8325f7cc6c1f64b147b01c6a6983.jpg"},{"name":"2M","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393950/eac4342ad27185a7bd5255614f13c0956d351e79.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3393950?t=1765555162","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393950/6869fb0b5b36a08a09a179044994ad1dbc78d05f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765555162","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393950/dee6c5c9383ed04a788629a74daa5f519608193a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765555162","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393950/dee6c5c9383ed04a788629a74daa5f519608193a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765555162","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone\u2019s favorite dinosaur with a gentle heart in the Jurassic Era, \u201cDino.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, indiscriminate slaughter by brutal dinosaurs has begun in a peaceful forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDino\u201d sees his lovely girlfriend, \u201cMeeshell\u201d and his friends trying to escape, and decides to fight for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curls up himself, transforms into a ball with hyper strong power, and attack the enemy dinosaurs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDino\u201d is taking a step into his epic adventure to bring peace back to the sky, sea and earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stages are inspired by the Earth 200 million years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This hierarchal action pinball game that you will explore on land, sea and sky, and attack the enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Natural disaster and sudden weather change will bring you more excitement. Volcanic explosions, tectonic movements, seas filled by lava, sand storms and more\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful visual arts and impressive sounds and music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gallery: view images from the original game\u2019s illustrations, posters, box design, etc. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jukebox: listen to any of the game music tracks any time you want. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewind/Turbo function: repeat something until you achieve perfection, or speed things up </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheats function: activate cheats that will make your mission a lot easier (infinite lives, invulnerability, etc.) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save state function: save wherever you want to in the game, and restart from that exact point </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screen filters: select from several filters to modify how the game looks (retro-style monitor, black-and-white, etc.) </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is re-release of \u201cDino Land\u201d which the first launched in 1990s for home consoles.</p>","developers":["Ratalaika Games S.L.","Shinyuden"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393950/368ad24c55681eb7ac76e8b94dd7eac23d1f449c/header.jpg?t=1765555162","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 LLC Shinyuden<br />\r\n\u00a9 Ratalaika Games S.L.<br />\r\n\u00a9 Edia Co.,Ltd.","linux_requirements":